AUDIO CLIP, "SWEET NOTHING"\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Fans, learning of the news overnight, sending their well wishes on social media, hoping there's no bad blood or antiheroes in the story.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And you know those Swifties, they're basically private eyes. Some of them had noticed that Alwyn had not been attending shows on Swift's latest tour. So, I'm sure we'll hear more about that.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah. That was noticed.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That was, you noticed it? All right, still coming up here on "Good Morning America" the huge box office bonanza for "Super Mario Bros." So, what's behind the success of these video games turned movies?\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230509ej490000g\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 PLAY OF THE DAY\b0\par\par\uc2 440 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DUELING RULINGS FROM FEDERAL COURTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABORTION PILL BATTLE\par \par \uc2 ABORTION PILL, PROTESTS, LANGEN, BAPTIST, SCHUMER\par \par \uc2 LEAK, SECURITY, CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUSTICE DEPT INVESTIGATING PENTAGON CLASSIFIED DOCS LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN OFFICIAL CALLS IT RUSSIA'S ATTEMPT TO SOW DOUBT AMONG ITS ALLIES\par \par \uc2 VIOLENCE, ISRAEL, PALESTINE, SYRIA, HECHT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDDLE EAST VIOLENCE AS HOLY DAYS CONVERGE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TENSIONS RISE AS ISRAELI MILITARY SAYS SYRIA FIRED ROCKETS\par \par \uc2 POPE FRANCIS, EASTER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THOUSANDS JOIN POPE FRANCIS FOR EASTER MASS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PONTIFF SKIPPED GOOD FRIDAY SERVICE AFTER HEALTH CONCERNS\par \par \uc2 PEARSON, SCHULMAN, QUALLS, JONES, SEXTON, PROTEST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GROWING OUTRAGE OVER EXPULSION OF BLACK LAWMAKERS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CALLS FOR THEM TO BE REINSTATED AFTER BEING KICKED OUT OVER PROTEST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, INDICTMENT\par \par \uc2 TRIAL, WALKER, SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GRAND JURY TO HEAR EVIDENCE IN DEADLY POLICE SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JAYLAND WALKER SHOTS MORE THAN 40 TIMES BY AKRON, OHIO OFFICERS\par \par \uc2 PROFITS, INFLATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FOOD INDUSTRY PROFITS SOAR AS CONSUMERS PAY MORE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AMERICANS REPORTEDLY SPENDING 7.3 BILLION ON FOOD THIS EASTER SUNDAY\par \par \uc2 WOODS, WITHDRAW, MASTERS\par \par \uc2 LAWSUIT, HAZING, BRENNAN, FRANTZ, GIBSON\par \par \uc2 PRIVACY, TESLA, HASKINS, LAWSUIT, FITZGERALD, STECKLOW\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TESLA PRIVACY CONCERNS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: OWNER SEEKS POTENTIAL CLASS ACTION SUIT INVOLVING CAMERAS ON CARS\par \par \uc2 SWIFT, ALWYN, BREAKUP\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CALLING IT QUITS?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REPORTS: TAYLOR SWIFT & JOE ALWYN BREAK UP AFTER SIX YEARS OF DATING\par \par \uc2 "SUPER MARIO BROS. MOVIE", ROBBINS\par \par \uc2 EASTER, DOGS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) We're back now with our "Play of the Day." And we're channeling a little bit of "Oh, Baby" here. These cute critters getting in to the Easter spirit.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Check out these beautiful African-painted dogs at a safari park in England enjoying these giant papier-m\u226\'00\'E2ch\u233\'00\'E9 Easter eggs. Instead of chocolates, dangerous to canines, some chunks of meat were hidden inside for a special treat. These endangered ring-tailed lemurs at a zoo in England were having an extravaganza,\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) A little violent.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Yeah, right? Of their own, chowing down on their favorite sweet potato treats. Lots of zoos getting into the spirit, offering the animals a chance to have an eggs-tra special day.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Love it.\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) I love that.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Having a good time and everything. Thank you so much for watching, everybody. Check out "GMA" live streaming on ABC News Live. Have a great rest of your weekend and happy Easter, everybody.\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Happy Easter.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Look for the pictures of his tank top.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230509ej490000i\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 DEMOCRATS RALLY BEHIND OUSTED TENNESSEE LAWMAKERS COULD THE TWO MEN SOON RETURN TO THE LEGISLATURE?\b0\par\par\uc2 722 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DUELING RULINGS FROM FEDERAL COURTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABORTION PILL BATTLE\par \par \uc2 ABORTION PILL, PROTESTS, LANGEN, BAPTIST, SCHUMER\par \par \uc2 LEAK, SECURITY, CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUSTICE DEPT INVESTIGATING PENTAGON CLASSIFIED DOCS LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN OFFICIAL CALLS IT RUSSIA'S ATTEMPT TO SOW DOUBT AMONG ITS ALLIES\par \par \uc2 VIOLENCE, ISRAEL, PALESTINE, SYRIA, HECHT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDDLE EAST VIOLENCE AS HOLY DAYS CONVERGE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TENSIONS RISE AS ISRAELI MILITARY SAYS SYRIA FIRED ROCKETS\par \par \uc2 POPE FRANCIS, EASTER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THOUSANDS JOIN POPE FRANCIS FOR EASTER MASS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PONTIFF SKIPPED GOOD FRIDAY SERVICE AFTER HEALTH CONCERNS\par \par \uc2 PEARSON, SCHULMAN, QUALLS, JONES, SEXTON, PROTEST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GROWING OUTRAGE OVER EXPULSION OF BLACK LAWMAKERS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CALLS FOR THEM TO BE REINSTATED AFTER BEING KICKED OUT OVER PROTEST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , INDICTMENT\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now, let's bring in ABC's \uc2 Jonathan Karl\uc2  who'll be hosting "This Week" later on. Jon, great to have you.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DEMOCRATS RALLY BEHIND OUSTED TENNESSEE LAWMAKERS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: COULD THE TWO MEN SOON RETURN TO THE LEGISLATURE?\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Great to be here.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That story, I mean, these two lawmakers, they have a big name for themselves on the national stage. What are the implications from this?\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I mean, first of all, they've now become two of the most prominent spokespeople for the issue of gun violence in the nation. These guys and, by the way, is there any doubt that they're going to be back in the Tennessee House of Representatives, either appointed or elected or both re-elected?\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Right. Yeah.\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) So, look, whatever Republicans were trying to do by expelling them, absolutely backfired.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah, all right. We will see what happens with that. Now, in the meantime we are less than a week since \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 's arraignment. He's using this moment to fuel his campaign.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABC NEWS IPSOS POLL ON TRUMP'S ARREST?\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) But where do voters stand and is there any real fallout for the former president?\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Well, you know, the conventional wisdom certainly among Republicans and also among Democrats as well is that, effectively, what the prosecutor did here, what Bragg did was ensure that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will win the Republican nomination. And there's even like some Republicans around Trump acting like they're celebrating this indictment. I don't see that in Trump, by the way, but certainly in some around him.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah.\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) But our new poll out this morning shows significant downgrading of Trump's approval rating, favorability rating, in the country.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SHOULD TRUMP HAVE BEEN CHARGED WITH A CRIME?\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Take a look at this. Half the country now is saying that he should have been charged with a crime.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Wow.\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) What's most interesting in these numbers, though, is what's behind them. And that is the down, how independents, that's the biggest shift.\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Basically, Democrats and Republicans, their views haven't changed.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah.\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) But independents significantly moved in the direction of saying \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , they believe, committed a crime and should have been indicted.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And so, we are going to see how that plays out as the campaign gets ramped up.\par \par \uc2 JONATHAN KARL\uc2  (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah. Yeah.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right, Jon, thank you so much. And you can tune in later this morning.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EXCLUSIVE SUNDAY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BILL BARR, FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: "THIS WEEK"\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Jon has an exclusive interview with former Attorney General Bill Barr, just days, as we mention, after \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 's historic arrest.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUSTIN PEARSON, EXPELLED TENNESEE LAWMAKER\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Plus, Jon speaks with Tennessee lawmaker Justin Pearson after he was expelled from office from protesting gun violence and gun violence on the state House floor. A lot to look forward to this morning, Whit.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230509ej4900007\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 FOOD INDUSTRY PROFITS SOAR AS CONSUMERS PAY MORE AMERICANS REPORTEDLY SPENDING 7.3 BILLION ON FOOD THIS EASTER SUNDAY\b0\par\par\uc2 575 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DUELING RULINGS FROM FEDERAL COURTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABORTION PILL BATTLE\par \par \uc2 ABORTION PILL, PROTESTS, LANGEN, BAPTIST, SCHUMER\par \par \uc2 LEAK, SECURITY, CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUSTICE DEPT INVESTIGATING PENTAGON CLASSIFIED DOCS LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN OFFICIAL CALLS IT RUSSIA'S ATTEMPT TO SOW DOUBT AMONG ITS ALLIES\par \par \uc2 VIOLENCE, ISRAEL, PALESTINE, SYRIA, HECHT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDDLE EAST VIOLENCE AS HOLY DAYS CONVERGE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TENSIONS RISE AS ISRAELI MILITARY SAYS SYRIA FIRED ROCKETS\par \par \uc2 POPE FRANCIS, EASTER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THOUSANDS JOIN POPE FRANCIS FOR EASTER MASS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PONTIFF SKIPPED GOOD FRIDAY SERVICE AFTER HEALTH CONCERNS\par \par \uc2 PEARSON, SCHULMAN, QUALLS, JONES, SEXTON, PROTEST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GROWING OUTRAGE OVER EXPULSION OF BLACK LAWMAKERS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CALLS FOR THEM TO BE REINSTATED AFTER BEING KICKED OUT OVER PROTEST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, INDICTMENT\par \par \uc2 TRIAL, WALKER, SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GRAND JURY TO HEAR EVIDENCE IN DEADLY POLICE SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JAYLAND WALKER SHOTS MORE THAN 40 TIMES BY AKRON, OHIO OFFICERS\par \par \uc2 PROFITS, INFLATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FOOD INDUSTRY PROFITS SOAR AS CONSUMERS PAY MORE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AMERICANS REPORTEDLY SPENDING 7.3 BILLION ON FOOD THIS EASTER SUNDAY\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now to the massive profits some food companies are reporting thanks to inflation. Yeah, that's the same inflation that's forcing millions of Americans to tighten their belts. ABC's Alexis Christoforous is here now with more. Alexis, good morning.\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Good morning to you, Gio. One thing is for certain, inflation doesn't take a holiday.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EASTER FOOD SPENDING\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Stubbornly high prices at the grocery store have American spending a record $7.3 billion on food alone this Easter Sunday.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FOOD PRICES, UP, FEB 2022 - FEB 2023\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Overall, inflation peaked last June, but food prices are still up more than 10% from year ago. While consumers' budgets get squeezed at the grocery store, major food companies are raking in record profits.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CONAGRA PROFITS: UP, 56% IN PREVIOUS QUARTER COMPARED TO 2022\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) \uc2 ConAgra\uc2  which owns Chef Boyardee, Hunt's and Slim Jim posting a 56% jump in profits last quarter, compared to a year ago.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 KRAFT HEINZ\uc2  PROFITS: UP, 450% IN PREVIOUS QUARTER\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) While quarterly profits at \uc2 Kraft Heinz\uc2  times, whose products include Jell-O, Oscar Meyer and Velveeta, soared nearly 450%.\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Companies passing higher cost for labor and transportation along to consumers. And as we the shoppers get used to paying more, economists warned that grocery prices could stay higher for longer, Gio.\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Oh, not something we want to hear. And, Alexis, what other factors are playing the role here in keeping food prices so high?\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) There are a number of factors. Of course, the ongoing war in Ukraine and extreme weather are impacting supply chains. But higher oil prices are another factor since they contribute to the cost of transporting the food.\par \par \uc2 ALEXIS CHRISTOFOROUS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Major oil-producing countries agreed recently to cut production just in time for the busy summer driving season. So, that means consumers could get hit with the double whammy in the coming weeks, higher prices at the grocery store and the gas pump. Guys?\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Oh, you are full of good news today, Alexis. Thank you. Appreciate it.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230509ej4900009\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 FRATERNITY FACING LAWSUIT OVER HAZING CLAIM KAPPA SIGMA PLEDGE SAYS INITIATION PUT HIM IN COMA\b0\par\par\uc2 843 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DUELING RULINGS FROM FEDERAL COURTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABORTION PILL BATTLE\par \par \uc2 ABORTION PILL, PROTESTS, LANGEN, BAPTIST, SCHUMER\par \par \uc2 LEAK, SECURITY, CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUSTICE DEPT INVESTIGATING PENTAGON CLASSIFIED DOCS LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN OFFICIAL CALLS IT RUSSIA'S ATTEMPT TO SOW DOUBT AMONG ITS ALLIES\par \par \uc2 VIOLENCE, ISRAEL, PALESTINE, SYRIA, HECHT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDDLE EAST VIOLENCE AS HOLY DAYS CONVERGE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TENSIONS RISE AS ISRAELI MILITARY SAYS SYRIA FIRED ROCKETS\par \par \uc2 POPE FRANCIS, EASTER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THOUSANDS JOIN POPE FRANCIS FOR EASTER MASS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PONTIFF SKIPPED GOOD FRIDAY SERVICE AFTER HEALTH CONCERNS\par \par \uc2 PEARSON, SCHULMAN, QUALLS, JONES, SEXTON, PROTEST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GROWING OUTRAGE OVER EXPULSION OF BLACK LAWMAKERS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CALLS FOR THEM TO BE REINSTATED AFTER BEING KICKED OUT OVER PROTEST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, INDICTMENT\par \par \uc2 TRIAL, WALKER, SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GRAND JURY TO HEAR EVIDENCE IN DEADLY POLICE SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JAYLAND WALKER SHOTS MORE THAN 40 TIMES BY AKRON, OHIO OFFICERS\par \par \uc2 PROFITS, INFLATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FOOD INDUSTRY PROFITS SOAR AS CONSUMERS PAY MORE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AMERICANS REPORTEDLY SPENDING 7.3 BILLION ON FOOD THIS EASTER SUNDAY\par \par \uc2 WOODS, WITHDRAW, MASTERS\par \par \uc2 LAWSUIT, HAZING, BRENNAN, FRANTZ, GIBSON\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right, we do start this half-hour, though, with a fraternity under fire now.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FRATERNITY FACING LAWSUIT OVER HAZING CLAIM\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FAMILY SPEAKS OUT AFTER KAPPA SIGMA PLEDGE SAYS INITIATION PUT HIM IN COMA\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) A former student at \uc2 San Diego State University\uc2  saying a night of hazing put him in a coma and his life has never been the same. ABC's Zohreen Shah is here with more on this lawsuit. Zohreen, good morning.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Good morning, Whit. And before we get to that lawsuit, San Diego state suspended this fraternity back in 2020 and they apparently kept operating in violation of that order. And now, a family is suing that fraternity, saying their hazing tactics almost killed their son.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) This morning, a family of a former \uc2 San Diego State University\uc2  student is filing a lawsuit against an off-campus fraternity and nine of its members, saying their freshman team nearly died during a hazing incident.\par \par \uc2 KAITLIN BRENNAN (SISTER OF BENJAMIN BRENNAN)\par \par \uc2 Pre-incident Ben was everyone's favorite guy. He lit up a room. And now, it feels like we're getting to know a new Ben.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) According to the lawsuit from Benjamin Brennan's family, two years ago when he was pledging Kappa Sigma fraternity, which the university said it expelled last year, frat members forced him to consume drugs and hard alcohol in amounts that would literally kill most people.\par \par \uc2 JAMES P FRANTZ (LEAD TRIAL LAWYER FRANTZ GROUP)\par \par \uc2 There are 750 milliliter bottle of Captain Morgan rum. He was instructed, he was commanded to drink it all and they provided tobacco and marijuana, and he was supposed to consume that as well.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) The lawsuit alleges that a fraternity member then drove Brennan to a nearby hospital. And according to the lawsuit, then dumped his lifeless body while attempting to avoid responsibility.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LAWSUIT\par \par \uc2 LINDSAY GIBSON (MOTHER OF BENJAMIN BRENNAN)\par \par \uc2 These boys just abandoned their brother and left him for dead. That's not, that's not brotherhood.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) The 19-year-old was in a coma. Two years later, Ben is still recovering.\par \par \uc2 JAMES P FRANTZ (LEAD TRIAL LAWYER FRANTZ GROUP)\par \par \uc2 He can't work now. And we don't know if he'll be able to. He can't go back to school now. All of those types of damages and all the emotional distress damages he's going to suffer.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Just two years prior to Brenna's incident, at the same university, Dylan Hernandez fell out of the top of a bunk bed in his campus dorm room, hit his head and later died. He had been heavily drinking at another fraternity. The university's Greek life organization once again being called into question. And the Brennan say Benjamin is facing an uncertain future.\par \par \uc2 LINDSAY GIBSON (MOTHER OF BENJAMIN BRENNAN)\par \par \uc2 Greek life is a big part of a college experience. But I want to caution the families to have a long, thoughtful serious conversation before your son joins that type of community because you might think, oh, not my son. My son is too smart. My son would never be involved in something like that. And that's exactly what I told myself. And I'm lucky that he's alive.\par \par \uc2 ZOHREEN SHAH (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You can just hear the pain in her voice. And the lawyers are also recommending that criminal charges be filed for hazing. They say a police investigation has been turnover to the DA's office. Janai?\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right, Zohreen, thank you for that update. Heartbreaking to hear that.\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah, it really is. You could hear that pain.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230509ej490000d\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 WEATHER\b0\par\par\uc2 546 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DUELING RULINGS FROM FEDERAL COURTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABORTION PILL BATTLE\par \par \uc2 ABORTION PILL, PROTESTS, LANGEN, BAPTIST, SCHUMER\par \par \uc2 LEAK, SECURITY, CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUSTICE DEPT INVESTIGATING PENTAGON CLASSIFIED DOCS LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN OFFICIAL CALLS IT RUSSIA'S ATTEMPT TO SOW DOUBT AMONG ITS ALLIES\par \par \uc2 VIOLENCE, ISRAEL, PALESTINE, SYRIA, HECHT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDDLE EAST VIOLENCE AS HOLY DAYS CONVERGE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TENSIONS RISE AS ISRAELI MILITARY SAYS SYRIA FIRED ROCKETS\par \par \uc2 POPE FRANCIS, EASTER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THOUSANDS JOIN POPE FRANCIS FOR EASTER MASS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PONTIFF SKIPPED GOOD FRIDAY SERVICE AFTER HEALTH CONCERNS\par \par \uc2 PEARSON, SCHULMAN, QUALLS, JONES, SEXTON, PROTEST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GROWING OUTRAGE OVER EXPULSION OF BLACK LAWMAKERS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CALLS FOR THEM TO BE REINSTATED AFTER BEING KICKED OUT OVER PROTEST\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, INDICTMENT\par \par \uc2 TRIAL, WALKER, SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GRAND JURY TO HEAR EVIDENCE IN DEADLY POLICE SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JAYLAND WALKER SHOTS MORE THAN 40 TIMES BY AKRON, OHIO OFFICERS\par \par \uc2 PROFITS, INFLATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FOOD INDUSTRY PROFITS SOAR AS CONSUMERS PAY MORE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AMERICANS REPORTEDLY SPENDING 7.3 BILLION ON FOOD THIS EASTER SUNDAY\par \par \uc2 GIO BENITEZ (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And we're going to turn it over now o the weather. Somara Theodore is here. You've got some good news for us?\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I do. Well, we've got a great Easter forecast coming up, and I can't wait to share that with you. But we're going to start first with some really interesting video out Fruit Heights, Utah. So, come with me about 20 miles north of Salt Lake City.\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Take a look at this mudslide. Two folks were running out of the barn to save the baby chickens and, unfortunately, they were injured as that barn collapsed.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SPRING THAW\par \par \uc2 SOMARA THEODORE (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now, usually, the catalysts behind these 