SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Can we say congratulations?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Please.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JENNIFER ANISTON & ADAM SANDLER LIVE IN TIMES SQUARE\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Mark Twain. I mean, amazing.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yes, yes.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Amazing.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That was (inaudible).\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 That was the mission. Robin, thank you.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) What is it like to have so many in that room celebrating you, Adam?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 We, we got emotional.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Got emotional.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 We didn't know that was going to happen.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Like a sucker punch.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 It was sweet, it was all great friends of mine there going up on stage, making speeches, family members making speeches, my wife made a great speech, my mom made a great speech. Everybody got us teared up. But it was a lot of funniness, a lot of people made fun of me and the way I look.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 You love it.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I loved it.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 You loved it.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And, Jen, we saw a picture of you and Drew Barrymore there. You both actually did a routine about playing Adam's, of being his love interest. So, how did that come about?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yes.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 It was just an idea that we thought would be funny, which is, because they're always, there was a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  thing a couple years ago and they were sort of comparing us and to who's the better, you know, movie wife, movie love. So, we just thought we would do a little bit on that.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah, you guys were funny, everybody loved them.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 We just played around. We just had fun.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You always have fun.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 But what a space, what a room.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I know. (Inaudible)\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Have you been there ever? That's gorgeous.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Oh, yes. It's impressive. As is, can we just talk about this one movie you all have coming up? Thank you.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) It just, it just, you know, we thought, how can they improve upon the first one? And what is it about working with this woman right here? This your third movie together.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 She's, she just doesn't miss. Funny, we lock-in together. We're married in the movie, so that makes it comfortable. We get to, we do love each other.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Love each. We have fun together. We have been together for over 30 years.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Oh, yeah.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Really?\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Together as good friends.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah, I know this youngster a long time and she's just one of the funniest people I know.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Sweet.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 And when I say try to be funny, she one-ups me, and then I start laughing. It's good. It's a good feeling.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 He likes to be funnier.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) We're going to take a, we're going to take a look at a clip where you both are being funny.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Let's go.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Let's see it.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Check it out, "Murder Mystery 2".\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Thank you.\par \par \uc2 CLIP FROM MOVIE, "MURDER MYSTERY 2"\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Okay, so that mote's like three meters? I think I can clear that.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Nick, three meters is like 10 feet.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I had a high school record for the long jump. And I'm not kidding you, I went further than that back in the day.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Ooh, did you?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 What did they call you back then, Nicky long legs?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 You're mocking me?\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 But I'm just telling you, you're not going to make that jump.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 It doesn't make me feel good to prove you wrong, but I'm going to go do that.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Okay.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 All right?\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Okay, from that angle it does look further than three meters.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) From that angle.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 You would have made that jump.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) No, I wouldn't make that jump.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 No, he wouldn't.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I think you would have.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Three meters?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah. Come on.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Let me ask you, in real life, between the two of you, who would be better at solving a murder mystery?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Wow. Wow. We all know it's Jennifer, it's okay, I'm fine with that.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 You've come to terms with it.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Jennifer could focus on things, I kind of drift off. If I was, I had to think of clues and what was wrong with something, I would, I'd probably maintain focus for about four or five seconds. And then I'd say, what would you think?\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Unless Jackie or your kids were involved.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Oh, boy, if it's a real situation maybe you're right.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Then you'd be like, or any of your family members.\par \p