oh, ooh, just like that?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah, yeah. They were going crazy for it.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That is like being at a Jets game.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I said dance. Keep rolling.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) They were going crazy for you all in Paris because it's set in Paris, and then you had that premiere there at the Eiffel Tower.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yes, at the Eiffel Tower.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) How was that? How was that.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Being in Paris with Jennifer, nothing is better if you're a famous person because literally, it doesn't matter how famous you are, if Jennifer is there, no one is looking at you. The whole place is like "Jennifer, Jennifer." I'm like, all right, I will get out of the way. They love Jen.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I wish. I wish. They love you, too.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 They are fine with me, they love you.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) What's it like walking in Paris with that guy?\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 He, first of all, walked almost every block in Paris.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah, I walked a lot. I got a new hip.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 So much so, he got a new hip because he walks so much.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I got a new hip after the shoot.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 This isn't the first live.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I don't blame Paris.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Is it its first live performance?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 This hip has never been on the show, it loves you. I'm scared he's going to tackle me.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) We mentioned your other wife in films, Drew Barrymore, earlier. She said she's waiting for the next...\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yes. Jennifer is going to write it.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I'm just going, why don't you all three just be in it?\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Ooh.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 That's what we've been, that's what we've been pitching.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 That would be fantastic. Yeah. Yes. Yes.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 We want to do all three of us together and just put an end to this competition.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah, exactly. There's no competition, two great ladies, but we're going to, we're going to, that would be amazing, doing a movie together, absolutely.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 That would be fun. All right.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) We will (inaudible). We're sold.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Sold? So, we'll be, we have a date back here at some point in a few years.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yes. I got to say, I enjoy being here with this man when he got the star on the Walk of Fame.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And you were there with Lisa Kudrow for your dear friend Courteney. Just talk about, the three of you all, that is surreal, Jennifer.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 You know, you don't, it's surreal moments because it feels like yesterday that it all began for all of us. You know? So, those are the moments that sort of make you stop and take pause and go, wow, we really have been doing this for a long time.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yeah, that's true.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I was so proud of my girl, and she's worked so hard. And she just...\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 She's funny as hell too, Courteney.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Oh, God, she's so funny and she's so special, she deserved it. And we were proud to be there.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) It was beautiful seeing you.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All of you are funny.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Not bad. Yeah. Yeah.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 It's kind of a requirement when you like...\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 When you go over to Aniston's house, she is...\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Because it makes you, I think you live longer if you laugh.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Amen.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I agree with that.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Yes.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Don't you think?\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 She surrounds herself with funny people, by the way. If I go, when I go to Jennifer's house for my wife, or we go to a party, everybody's laughing, everybody's funny. Nobody is, nobody is boring to talk to. There's a lot of...\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 I'm teasing. I'm teasing. Everybody.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) She teased because she cares. But again, thank you, it means a lot that you are here. And thank you for just the joy, the joy that you bring into our lives. We couldn't say that better.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Oh, thank you.\par \par \uc2 ADAM SANDLER ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Thank you, Robin.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) We want people to know that "Murder Mystery 2" premiers March 31st on Netflix. And the ceremony celebrating Adam's Mark Twain Prize airs Sunday.\par \par \uc2 JENNIFER ANISTON ("MURDER MYSTERY 2")\par \par \uc2 Watch, watch, watch.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Yeah. Oh, we've got an 11-year-old, a little 11-year-old girl saving animals one lemonade at a time. Sounds like a movie, doesn't it, guys?\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Delanie. Yeah.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) We'll be right back.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 STORY SYNOPSES\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020230424ej3m0000m\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 DESANTIS: I CAN BEAT BIDEN FL GOV. SAYS NO FINAL DECISION ABOUT RUNNING\b0\par\par\uc2 849 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 March 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: World News Tonight with David Muir\par \uc2 WNT\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , EVIDENCE, CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS, HOWELL, DANIELS\par \par \uc2 OTIENO, MURDER, POLICE CUSTODY, VIDEO, OUKO\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: VIDEO FROM POLICE CUSTODY DEATH\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MAJOR STORM CORSSING U.S.\par \par \uc2 STRIKE, LAUSD, SERVICE WORKERS, CARVALHO, ARIAS, JACKSON\par \par \uc2 PUTIN, XI, KREMLIN, WAR, UKRAINE, KISHIDA, BUCHA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PUTIN & XI CLOSE RANKS\par \par \uc2 DESANTIS, FOX NATION, MORGAN, BIDEN, PRESIDENT, RUN\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now, back here at home and the race for the White House. Tonight, Florida governor \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , who hasn't yet officially announced he's running, in a new interview. What he's saying about \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and about President Biden, when DeSantis - DeSantis was asked, could he beat Biden? Here's Rachel Scott.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DEVELOPING NOW\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DESANTIS: I CAN BEAT BIDEN: FL GOV. SAYS NO FINAL DECISION ABOUT RUNNING\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Tonight, nearly two weeks after traveling to Iowa and one day after taking a swipe at \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  over the hush money scandal, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  in a new Fox Nation interview, telling Piers Morgan, "If I were to run I'm running against Biden."\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: "...ULTIMATELY YOU KNOW THE GUY I'M GONNA FOCUS ON IS BIDEN BECAUSE I THINK HE'S FAILED THE COUNTRY.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: I THINK THE COUNTRY WANTS A CHANGE. I THINK THEY WANT A FRESH START AND A NEW DIRECTION AND SO WE'LL BE VERY VOCAL ABOUT THAT."\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SOURCE: THE NEW YORK POST\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Acknowledging he and Trump would be competing for the Republican Presidential nomination, but saying, "ultimately, you know the guy I'm going to focus on is Biden, because I think he's failed the country." The Florida governor saying, "I think the country wants a change. I think they want a fresh start and a new direction and so we'll be very vocal about that." Another very strong signal he is running without officially saying it yet.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PIERS MORGAN: "DO YOU THINK YOU COULD BEAT BIDEN?"\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DESANTIS: "I THINK SO."\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) DeSantis, who walked with Biden and their wives after Hurricane Ian, in this new interview asked, "Do you think you could beat Biden?" The governor saying, "I think so." All of this as Trump faces potential legal peril. And 24 hours after DeSantis said this about the former President.\par \par \uc2 GOV. RON DESANTIS (REP) (FLORIDA)\par \par \uc2 I don't know what goes into paying hush money to a porn star to, to secure silence over some type of alleged affair. I just, I can't speak to that.\par \par \uc2 RACHEL SCOTT (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Florida governor \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  making it clear he has not made a final decision yet, saying he has a lot of work to do over the course of the coming months. Sources tell us that any announcement would likely come after the legislative session ends in May. David?\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) But we all know, certainly sounds like a candidate, which is why you're could've ring him. Rachel Scott tonight. Thank you, Rachel.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SUPREME COURT: DEAF STUDENT WINS EDUCATION CASE\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) To the Supreme Court now. A unanimous ruling in a case involving a deaf man who the justices allowed to sue his school district under the Americans With Disabilities Act.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Miguel Luna Perez alleged his Michigan school failed to give him an appropriate education without a qualified interpreter. All nine justices sided with Luna Perez, allowing him to sue for damages, even though the school said he hadn't fully exhausted administrative remedies.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RECORD STREAK: HOME PRICES FALL AFTER DECADE\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) To the economy tonight, home prices falling for the first time in more than a decade.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HOME PRICED: FEBRUARY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DOWN 0.2%: MEDIAN PRICE $363,000\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Last month, home prices were down .2%. The median home price now $363,000 and with those easing prices, even with high interest rates, home sales were up more than 14% last month. That's the first increase in a year.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) When we come back on this busy news night, the new study this evening on birth control and breast cancer and the new concerns. And two new national monuments in this country and we'll show you them.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BIRTH CONTROL & CANCER STUDY\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Tonight, a new study warning about a slightly greater potential link between birth control and breast cancer.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Researchers now say birth control methods using just one hormone may raise the risk of breast cancer similar to using a combination of hormones. Birth control pills containing both estrogen and progestin have long been known to slightly increase the chance of breast cancer. That risk decreases the more time women stay off birth control.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) When we come back here, we pay tribute to an NBC legend. And then, saving the turtles tonight.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document WNT0000020230323ej3l00007\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\row } \trowd\trga